<div id="urduTextPath">علی اصغر (ع)/بانو پچھلے پہر اصغر کے لئے روتی ہے</div>
<p>bano pichle pahar asghar ke liye roti hai<br />
ek wo jaagti hai qalq-e- khuda soti hai<br />
sar ko bhi peet-ti hai jaan ko bhi khoti hai<br />
ye ajab gham hai ke taskeen nahi hoti hai</p>

<p>peet'te peetite behosh jo hojaati hai<br />
ali asghar ali asghar ki sadaa aati hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kabhi kone me wo mu dhaamp ke chillati hai<br />
aur kabhi sahen me ghabraake nikal aati hai<br />
kookh pakde huwe har ek taraf jaati hai<br />
dhoondti hai magar asghar ko nahi paati hai</p>

<p>tan ko larzish hai juda aur hai mu zard juda<br />
dil tadapta hai juda seene me hai dard juda<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kabhi kehti hai ke ghar me mere andhiyaara hai<br />
ali asghar ki judaayi ne mujhe maara hai<br />
haaye main ghar me hoon jungle me mera pyaara hai<br />
meherbaani jo kare mout to chut'kaara hai</p>

<p>kab talak raato'n ko ham nala-o faryaad kare'n<br />
ya ilaahi ali asghar mujhe ab yaad kare'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>god phailaake kabhi kehti hai dilbar aaja<br />
rooh be-chain hai aaja ali asghar aaja<br />
dil tadapta hai mera god ke andar aaja<br />
fatema ke liye aaja paye hyder aaja</p>

<p>boond paani ke liye haaye teri jaan gayi<br />
aa mai sadqe gayi waari gayi qurbaan gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aake seene se mere seena lagado beta<br />
aag bhadki hai kaleje me bujhaado beta<br />
qushk mu apna mere mu se mila do beta<br />
ek nazar chand si tasveer dikhado beta</p>

<p>jaao phir quld me maa tumko na behlaayegi<br />
ek dam se na ziyada tumhe tahraayegi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>loriyaa'n hum tumhe aye laal diya karte the<br />
aap lete huwe jhule me hasa karte the<br />
ghutniyou'n ghutniyou'n gar aap chala karte the<br />
kurta pakde huwe ham saath raha karte the</p>

<p>haaye maa baap se qismat ne chudhaya tumko<br />
soone jangal me meri jaan sulaya tumko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>yaad har cheez teri aati hai aye nek qisaal<br />
meri nazro'n ke tale phirti hai wo teri chaal<br />
juti juti wo bhawe'n aur jhandoole wo baal<br />
choti choti wo teri ungliyaa'n aye mere laal</p>

<p>bu-e gul aati thi beta tere pairaahan me<br />
qoob khilti thi ali band teri gardan me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qalq sab soti hai raato ko gharou me apne<br />
ham agar lete hai karwat to qasam lo hamse<br />
neend aati mere pahlu me agar tum hote<br />
tum to aye laqte jigar god me marqad ke gaye</p>

<p>yaad is paalne waali ki bhulaayi tumne<br />
paayenti baap ki aye laal basaayi tumne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>haaye asghar na tera dain huwa maa se adaa<br />
bojh koi meri gardan se na utraa tera<br />
naa teri saalgiraah ki, na tera doodh baddha<br />
naa lahad tujh ko mili aur na kafan tujh ko mila</p>

<p>tum to maare gaye chaati pa litaau'n kisko<br />
chote chote ye shalooke mai pahanaoo'n kisko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>bain karti thi yeh sar peet ke bano dukhya<br />
aage is tarha se hai raavi-e pur gham likkha<br />
aayi ek simt se waa'n peetne rone ki sadaa<br />
har taraf bano-e- bekas ne ba hasrat dekha</p>

<p>roke kehne lagi maaloom nahi hota hai<br />
koi baitha huwa hamraah mere rota hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>koun hai meri tarha dukh me phasa aye daawar<br />
koun bekas hai meri tarha se rota aakar<br />
ye wo kehti thi ke ye aayi sadaa us jaa par<br />
aye bahu quld se aaya hai yahaan paighambar</p>

<p>tere rone ne aziyyat mujhe pahonchayi hai<br />
qabr se aah teri mujh ko uthaa laayi hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ghash me bano ne jo ye fatema zehra se suna<br />
haath phaila diye aur god me asghar ko liya<br />
mu se mu uske mala aur labou ko chooma<br />
qoob lipta ke kaleje se ye roro ke kaha</p>

<p>thi judaayi ne teri, aag lagaayi beta<br />
tum ne wo aag mere dil ki bujhaayi beta<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>